 gbrain is set up and Claude Code is wired, so memory works now. In effect: search mode conservative; agents save only what you ask them to remember, until you turn on automatic saving (salient is recommended: durable facts you state, saved with provenance). Report back (Wakeshift): off. gbrain wakeshift enable turns it on. Upkeep: free upkeep runs on its own while your agent's gbrain session is open. Nothing is deleted or paid for without you. Turn off: gbrain config set maintenance.auto false. Optional schedule: gbrain maintain --schedule. Conversation archive: on. gbrain keeps one redacted page per conversation per day from your agent sessions (Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Hermes, Grok) in the conversations source, written by the maintenance pass. Without an embedding key nothing leaves this machine. Turn off: gbrain transcripts archive off. Estimated downstream input cost of the retrieved payload at 10K queries/month (Haiku 5.5 / Sonnet 5.5 / Opus 5.5): conservative $4 / $80 / $160, balanced $10 / $200 / $400, tokenmax $20 / $400 / $800 per month. Nothing needs an answer now; tell me any time if you want to change any of these, and I'll apply it. Want a personal or company brain? I can add starter pages (facts, voice and decisions) and import a notes or docs folder you pick. 
 [
 {
  "id": "search_mode",
  "default": "conservative",
  "reason": "No chat key (Anthropic/OpenAI/Google) and no ready reranker — conservative keeps a tight 4K budget; balanced's reranker could not run.",
  "opts": [
   "conservative: gbrain config set search.mode conservative",
   "balanced: gbrain config set search.mode balanced",
   "tokenmax: gbrain config set search.mode tokenmax"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "writeback",
  "default": "off",
  "reason": "In effect now: agents save only what the user asks them to remember. salient is recommended for a personal brain; it is opt-in, so it turns on only when the user picks it.",
  "opts": [
   "salient: gbrain config set memory.auto_writeback salient",
   "all: gbrain config set memory.auto_writeback all",
   "off: gbrain config set memory.auto_writeback off"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "upkeep",
  "default": "on",
  "reason": "In effect now: the agent's gbrain serve runs the free upkeep tier while idle; nothing needs an answer.",
  "opts": [
   "on: ",
   "off: gbrain config set maintenance.auto false"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "conversation_archive",
  "default": "on",
  "reason": "In effect now: on by default on a personal brain; nothing needs an answer.",
  "opts": [
   "on: ",
   "off: gbrain transcripts archive off"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "brain_shape",
  "default": "none",
  "reason": "Nothing is written until the user picks; memory already works without it.",
  "opts": [
   "personal: gbrain setup claude-code --shape personal",
   "company: gbrain setup claude-code --shape company",
   "both: gbrain setup claude-code --shape both",
   "company_team: gbrain setup claude-code --shape company --team",
   "none: "
  ]
 }
]
NOTICE hosted_option coaching 
